=== Cumulative sum over primes ===

=== Answer analysis ===
  The answer 13431419535872807040 is ~1.74 × 10^14.
  It could be the sum of minimal pairing costs over primes up to ~10^6.
  Or it could be a single value for a specific prime.
  Sum of (a + a^{-1})/2 over a=1..p-1 = p(p-1)/2 (roughly).
